title: 竞技场魔法书与技能触发
tags: 竞技场技能触发 AI生成

!! 魔法书与技能触发方式

技能没有直接代码级API。玩家无法在代码中直接调用 `blink()` 或 `strike()`。所有技能释放都通过签名链模式匹配触发。

魔法书是图书馆中的掉落物品，记载特定技能的触发配方。玩家在游戏内找到魔法书后，得知某个技能需要怎样的签名链模式才能触发。

```ts
export interface Spellbook {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  skillId: string;
  triggerRecipes: TriggerRecipe[];
  discovered: boolean;
}
```

!! 触发配方

配方定义签名链中需要匹配的连续片段：

```ts
export interface TriggerRecipe {
  id: string;
  description: string;
  requiredSequences: SequenceConstraint[];
  optionalEffects: SequenceConstraint[];
}

export interface SequenceConstraint {
  id: string;
  repeat: number;
  sequence: WatermarkKind[];
  constraints: PatternConstraints;
}
```

示例：闪现技能配方

```ts
const blinkRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'blinkMobility',
  description: '短距离空间跃迁',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'baseActivation',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        contiguous: true,
        pipelineConsumesObserverOutput: true,
        decoratorConsumesPipelineOutput: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'shorterPreparation',
      repeat: 3,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        contiguous: true,
        distinctEventWindows: true,
        distinctDecoratorSlots: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'longerRange',
      repeat: 2,
      sequence: ['factoryMethod', 'pipeline', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        distinctFactorySources: true,
        pipelineStepsMustDiffer: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'cooldownReduction',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['stateMachine', 'commandTrace', 'repository', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        stateMustAdvance: true,
        commandMustBeReplayable: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};
```

!! 赛周新增配方

每赛周可能新增魔法书，记载新技能或已有技能的新触发方式。已有的常用技能保持稳定，不会全局随机调整。

```ts
// 赛周新增：碰撞后爆炸
const collisionExplosionRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'collisionExplosion',
  description: 'projectile 碰撞后触发范围爆炸',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'collisionDetection',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['observer'],
      constraints: {
        eventTopic: 'projectileCollision',
        distinctEventWindows: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'largerBlast',
      repeat: 2,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        eventTopic: 'areaDamage',
        distinctEventWindows: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};
```

!! 技能状态反馈作为咏唱API

技能释放后，其状态反馈不通过独立API返回，而是作为咏唱API中的事件源。玩家通过观察者模式订阅这些事件。

例如一个 projectile 技能：

| 反馈类型 | 咏唱API事件 | 获取方式 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 碰撞检测 | `projectileCollision` | 订阅事件窗口 |
| 命中回调 | `targetHit` | 订阅回调事件 |
| 范围命中 | `areaDamage` | 订阅范围事件 |
| 飞行轨迹 | `projectileMovement` | 订阅位置更新 |

```ts
class CollisionDetector {
  private collisionKey?: EventKey;

  attach(events: EventKeyRuntime): void {
    events.on('projectileCollision', key => {
      this.collisionKey = key;
    });
  }

  async produce(): Promise<ObserverSeal> {
    if (!this.collisionKey) throw new MissingEventError('projectileCollision');
    return observerRuntime.fromEventKey({
      key: this.collisionKey,
      topic: 'projectileCollision',
    });
  }
}
```

碰撞后爆炸的组合效果：

```ts
const explosionChain = new ChantChainBuilder()
  .withObserver(new CollisionDetector())
  .withPipeline(new BlastRadiusStep())
  .withDecorator(new ExplosionAmplifier())
  .build();
```

!! 环境状态作为咏唱API

地图环境状态同样通过咏唱API查询，不是独立接口：

| 环境信息 | 咏唱API | 获取方式 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 区域供能状态 | `areaPower.query()` | 仓储查询或事件订阅 |
| 敌方位置 | `enemyPositions.subscribe()` | 观察者订阅 |
| 地形信息 | `terrain.read()` | 适配器读取 |
| 能量节点状态 | `nodeStatus.query()` | 状态机查询 |

```ts
class AreaPowerQuery implements ChantStep {
  async execute(context: ChantContext): Promise<QuerySeal> {
    const status = await context.codex.areaPower.query({
      sector: context.params.targetSector,
    });
    return queryRuntime.seal(status);
  }
}
```

